#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "操作指南：排查被拒绝的构建或包"
msgstr "How-to: Troubleshoot a rejected build or package"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "每一次拒绝都指向一个被违反的源文件或包契约。修好那个契约再校验；不要为了得到一个包而放宽容差、重排数据或切换物理模式。"
msgstr "Every rejection points to a violated source-file or package contract. Repair that contract and validate again; do not loosen tolerances, reorder data, or switch physics modes just to obtain a package."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:5
msgid "框架不匹配"
msgstr "Frame mismatch"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:7
msgid "点坐标、响应分量、外部场分量和可选的基分量要分开检查。框架字符串是精确身份；动态几何要求位姿源等于点框架、位姿目标等于路径框架。形状相同不代表框架相同，旋转会同时改变点位置和矢量分量的含义。"
msgstr "Check point coordinates, response components, external-field components, and optional basis components separately. Frame strings are exact identities; dynamic geometry requires the pose source to equal the point frame and the pose target to equal the path frame. Equal shapes do not imply equal frames; rotation changes both point locations and the meaning of vector components."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid "点或通道顺序不匹配"
msgstr "Point or channel order mismatch"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "逐行比较标识符。在权威点集上重新生成场导出；改过采样网格后，所有依赖的场文件必须重新生成。不要单独排序某一个文件。硬件通道必须严格按响应列顺序出现。"
msgstr "Compare identifiers row by row. Regenerate field exports on the authoritative point set; after changing the sampling grid, every dependent field file must be regenerated. Never sort a single file on its own. Hardware channels must appear in exactly the response-column order."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "单位被拒绝"
msgstr "Units rejected"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "v0.1 只消费规范 SI 源文件。把非 SI 导出通过确定性、经过评审的预处理步骤转换，保留原始文件和转换记录，再导入转换后的文件。改列名或属性名不是单位转换。"
msgstr "v0.1 consumes canonical SI artifacts only. Convert non-SI exports through a deterministic, reviewed preprocessing step, keep the original files and the conversion record, and import the converted artifacts. Renaming a column or attribute is not a unit conversion."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "输出目录已存在或被改动"
msgstr "Output directory exists or was modified"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:19
msgid "导出到新目录。便携包恰好包含六个文件；多余注释、被修改的字节或编辑过的 manifest 元数据都会让校验失败。分析文件放在包旁边，而不是包里面。"
msgstr "Export to a new directory. A portable package contains exactly six files; extra notes, modified bytes, or edited manifest metadata fail validation. Keep analysis beside the package, not inside it."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:21
msgid "动态响应不匹配"
msgstr "Dynamic response mismatch"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:23
msgid "校验器会用打包的路径、贡献、点集和第一个位姿重建参考响应；不匹配意味着这些成员描述的不是同一个物理模型。从一组一致的源重新构建；没有固定矩阵回退。"
msgstr "The validator rebuilds the reference response from the packaged paths, contributions, point set, and first pose; a mismatch means these members do not describe the same physical model. Rebuild from one consistent set of sources; there is no fixed-matrix fallback."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:25
msgid "一般原则"
msgstr "General principles"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid "先读错误信封里的 `hint`，它指向具体修复路径。"
msgstr "Read the `hint` in the error envelope first; it points to the concrete fix."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:28
msgid "每次只修一个契约，然后重新校验，避免同时引入新问题。"
msgstr "Fix one contract at a time, then revalidate, to avoid introducing new problems."

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:29
msgid "如果你发现自己想“绕过”某个检查，几乎总是说明源文件或声明本身就错了。"
msgstr "If you catch yourself trying to 'bypass' a check, the source file or declaration is almost certainly wrong."
